<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Uma surpresa para Monique</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}

body{
  margin:0;
  min-height:100vh;
  overflow:hidden;
  background:#030305;
  color:#eee;
  font-family:Georgia,serif;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center
}

body:before{
  content:"";
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,#321326 0,#09070b 48%,#000 100%);
  opacity:.9
}

.card{
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
  width:min(90%,430px);
  padding:38px 25px;
  text-align:center;
  border:1px solid #472238;
  border-radius:25px;
  background:rgba(8,6,10,.76);
  box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(160,20,90,.16)
}

.lock{
  font-size:44px;
  animation:pulse 2s infinite
}

h1{
  font-size:30px;
  margin:15px 0 8px;
  letter-spacing:1px
}

.sub{
  color:#b99eae;
  font-size:16px;
  line-height:1.5
}

button{
  margin-top:24px;
  border:1px solid #8b3d68;
  border-radius:30px;
  padding:13px 24px;
  background:#130b12;
  color:#fff;
  font-size:16px;
  cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(190,50,120,.15)
}

#secret{
  display:none;
  margin-top:24px;
  animation:appear 1s ease
}

.age{
  font-size:72px;
  color:#e85b9b;
  text-shadow:0 0 28px #a82c69;
  font-weight:bold
}

.message{
  font-size:18px;
  line-height:1.65;
  color:#eadce5
}

.heart{
  position:fixed;
  bottom:-30px;
  z-index:1;
  opacity:0;
  animation:rise 8s linear forwards
}

@keyframes rise{
  10%{opacity:.35}
  100%{
    transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(25deg);
    opacity:0
  }
}

@keyframes pulse{
  50%{
    transform:scale(1.08);
    text-shadow:0 0 25px #d33b81
  }
}

@keyframes appear{
  from{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(12px)
  }
  to{
    opacity:1;
    transform:none
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

  <div class="lock">🔒</div>

  <h1>Monique...</h1>

  <div class="sub">
    Você encontrou uma coisa que não era para passar despercebida.
  </div>

  <button id="secretBtn" onclick="openSecret()">
    Descobrir o segredo
  </button>

  <div id="secret">

    <div class="age">18</div>

    <div class="message">
      Então era isso... ❤️<br><br>

      Hoje começa uma nova fase da sua vida.<br>

      Espero que seus 18 anos tragam momentos inesquecíveis,
      muitos motivos para sorrir e pessoas especiais ao seu lado.<br><br>

      <b>Feliz aniversário, Monique! 🎂✨</b>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<script>

function openSecret(){

  document.getElementById('secretBtn').style.display='none';

  document.getElementById('secret').style.display='block';

  for(let i=0;i<35;i++){

    setTimeout(()=>{

      let h=document.createElement('div');

      h.className='heart';

      h.textContent=['♥','✦','♡']
      [Math.floor(Math.random()*3)];

      h.style.left=Math.random()*100+'vw';

      h.style.fontSize=(12+Math.random()*18)+'px';

      document.body.appendChild(h);

      setTimeout(()=>h.remove(),8000);

    },i*90);

  }

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
